o Citadel and Nexus formations award 500 each; the final formation uses the normal clear bonus. Earn an extra life every 12,000 points, up to nine lives.</p><p><strong>Every collected power-up earns 150 points.</strong> Pickup points are added directly, without a combo multiplier. Multiball, Laser and Piercing can build brick combos. Wide, Slow and Shield help preserve lives. Sticky helps you aim, but each catch resets the combo. Each Extra life retained at a normal clear adds 150 to its bonus.</p><p><strong>Speed bonus: up to 2,000 points for each board.</strong> Subtract 10 points for every whole active second: a 40-second clear earns 1,600; a 100-second clear earns 1,000; at 200 seconds the bonus reaches zero. Each Citadel and Nexus formation earns its own speed bonus. Leaderboards rank by score, then world reached, then shortest active play time. Pauses, cutscenes and waiting to launch after a life loss do not count toward time. Losing a life or saving and resuming does not reset the board timer.</p><p>Your personal best combines Adventure and Daily Challenge runs. Practice does not update it.</p></section><p class="small">Adventure follows all sixteen worlds. Practice lets you try any world. The daily challenge is the same seeded world for everyone on its UTC date.</p><button class="button primary" data-close>Got it</button></dialog>
